coal that remembers fire.\n\nAnd the choice, the songs say, is always the same: hope is the strongest magic. In Dragonpeak and everywhere, forever.\n\nRowan Ember and the dwarf Bram Ironhold grew old telling the tale, arguing over every detail, and Dragonpeak prospered. The prophecy, the elders admitted, had never named a chosen one at all. It had named a choice.'}]}

